<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  com.nuzantara.proprioception : the boundary reconciliation organ, LaunchAgent
  mode. Runs scripts/proprioception.py with NO arguments: the report is written
  to ~/.nuzantara-proprioception/last.{json,md} (atomic rename) and the exit code
  is the ORGAN's own health, not the fleet's. Canon (probe registry, severities,
  fix lines) lives in the script; this file only schedules it.

  This closes the script's own recorded debt, verbatim from its docstring: "v1
  has NO cron: with no session there is no alarm. This is ACCEPTED and recorded
  (PENDING-ARMS); the receptor is the consumption point." The receptor
  (scripts/hooks/proprioception_sessionstart.sh) stays the consumption point; it
  just stops depending on somebody having typed the auditor's name.

  NOTE ON COMMENT STYLE, paid for here: an XML comment may not contain a double
  hyphen. plutil accepts one anyway; expat (which scripts/lint_plist_keepalive.py
  uses) refuses the whole file and reports the plist as unparseable, so a CLI
  flag is spelled in words below, never with its dashes.

  No strict flag. The strict flag exits 1 when any P1 has DIVERGED, i.e. exactly
  when the organ is doing its job, and launchd would then record `last exit code
  = 1` for a healthy run. Attribution to launchd is read as `runs` incremented
  with last exit 0 (`launchctl print gui/$(id -u)/com.nuzantara.proprioception`),
  never from the report's mtime: the report has no invocation field, and an mtime
  proves only that SOMETHING wrote it. Exit 2 stays the real alarm (no probes
  ran, report unwritable, or registry invalid).

  StartInterval 1800 (30 min). Measured on Pro 2026-09-11: a full 16 probe run
  is 18.4s wall, about 1% of the interval, so the rollback trigger "runs longer
  than its own interval" has two orders of magnitude of margin. The receptor
  goes LOUD at 48h, so 30 min is not what keeps the report fresh; it is what
  makes a P1 reach the NEXT boot rather than the next but one, and what lets a
  window's acceptance step observe a scheduled run inside its own appetite.
  KeepAlive false: this is a one shot, and KeepAlive true on a one shot reads
  every ordinary exit as a death (superscar #7).

  Environment: HOME and PATH only, plus PROPRIOCEPTION_INVOKED_BY. That is not a
  credential: it is the literal string "launchd", so a future report can name its
  own invoker instead of inferring it. Verified 2026-09-11 on Pro that this exact
  environment (`env -i` with HOME and PATH alone) produces the SAME 16 per probe
  verdicts as a full interactive shell, diff empty, exit 0: no probe silently
  degrades to UNPROBEABLE under launchd's bare environment.

  Umask 0077 applies to files the JOB creates; it does NOT apply to
  StandardOutPath/StandardErrorPath, which launchd creates itself under its own
  umask. Every ~/logs/*.log on this fleet is 0644, measured (S2, Kimi council
  finding M3). The proprioception log carries filesystem paths and process
  command lines, never contents; the log files are still pre created 0600 below
  so launchd appends to an existing inode and keeps its mode.

  Install:
    umask 077 && : >> ~/logs/proprioception.log \
      && : >> ~/logs/proprioception.err.log \
      && chmod 600 ~/logs/proprioception.log ~/logs/proprioception.err.log && \
    install -m 0644 infra/launchagents/com.nuzantara.proprioception.plist \
      ~/Library/LaunchAgents/ && \
    launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) \
      ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.nuzantara.proprioception.plist

  Rollback:
    launchctl bootout gui/$(id -u)/com.nuzantara.proprioception
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.nuzantara.proprioception</string>

    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>HOME</key>
        <string>/Users/nuzantara</string>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
        <key>PROPRIOCEPTION_INVOKED_BY</key>
        <string>launchd</string>
    </dict>

    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin/python3</string>
        <string>/Users/nuzantara/nuzantara/scripts/proprioception.py</string>
    </array>

    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>/Users/nuzantara/nuzantara</string>

    <key>StartInterval</key>
    <integer>1800</integer>
    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>
    <key>KeepAlive</key>
    <false/>
    <key>ProcessType</key>
    <string>Background</string>
    <key>Umask</key>
    <integer>63</integer>

    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/nuzantara/logs/proprioception.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/nuzantara/logs/proprioception.err.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
